1
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,799
Why won't she help me?

2
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,480
Personality.

3
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,079
Temperament.

4
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:52,120
You should work on evolving yourself.

5
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:55,840
Haven't I evolved enough?

6
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,760
I even went to see Xiao Chuan today,

7
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,920
wanting to find out

8
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,719
how he actually got hurt,

9
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:01,480
and whether

10
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,480
it had anything to do with

11
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:04,680
those terrorists in District A9.

12
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:07,400
He even fell into that deep ditch,

13
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:10,080
and ended up hurting himself.

14
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,280
I really wanted to do things right,

15
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,960
but every time, it turns into a mess.

16
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:17,960
Guess that's my hidden talent.

17
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,719
Sha Lan loves food.

18
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:26,039
Lately, she's been bugging Old Captain

19
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,719
to get her Peking duck.

20
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,919
Figure it out yourself.

21
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:30,639
Thanks.

22
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,840
Wei Tian, I knew it.

23
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,479
You'd never leave me hanging.

24
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,080
Hello.

25
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:49,840
Hello.

26
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,039
I'll take a pound of this.

27
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:57,360
This one? Sure.

28
00:02:58,199 --> 00:02:58,800
Take care!

29
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:03,840
And that one.

30
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,479
Sure.

31
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,159
I want this too.

32
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,080
Pack some of that for me too.

33
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:35,520
Here's the money.

34
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,039
Just a moment.

35
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,319
Here you go.

36
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:44,000
Thanks.

37
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:44,919
You're welcome.

38
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:45,520
Thank you.

39
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,479
I'm off.

40
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,159
Goodbye.

41
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,080
Anda!

42
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,039
Why did you come all this way to shop?

43
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:09,319
They have a great selection here.

44
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:12,039
Let me introduce you. This is Yang Di.

45
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,360
Hello.

46
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,039
H-Hello.

47
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,920
By the way, Rossi,

48
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,519
why don't you join them tonight

49
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:21,000
for dinner at the Plato Hotel?

50
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,199
I already spoke with Qu,

51
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,720
and Wei Tian agreed.

52
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,879
You're up to something, aren't you?

53
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,720
Do you want Sha Lan

54
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,160
to download TV shows

55
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:36,279
for the injured Xiao Chuan to watch?

56
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,920
No, no, no!

57
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:40,480
I accidentally broke his RC plane.

58
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,639
Only Sha Lan can fix it, so I need her help.

59
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:46,319
Anda,

60
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:49,040
if Xiao Chuan got hurt

61
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,519
because he did something bad,

62
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,240
would you still take care of him?

63
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,800
Of course not.

64
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,839
Then take my advice and leave him alone.

65
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,160
Let's go. I'll give you a ride.

66
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,160
Come on, help me carry these.

67
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:17,639
Peking duck!

68
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:19,519
How did you know I love this?

69
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,120
It must've been you.

70
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,199
Otherwise, how would she know

71
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:24,040
to cheer me up with Peking duck?

72
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,120
Anda actually

73
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:27,319
spent half the day preparing this.

74
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,560
Just eat and enjoy.

75
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,319
I remember when I was little,

76
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,160
I had this all the time.

77
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,879
Just eat. Stop talking already.

78
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:38,519
Come on, eat the duck first.

79
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,959
Here, have a taste.

80
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,560
The plane is fixed.

81
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,000
That's awesome.

82
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,040
Um...

83
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:59,759
Could you wash this and chop it into pieces?

84
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:00,399
Sure.

85
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,120
Looks great.

86
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,079
It's just like new!

87
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,680
Anda, you're incredible.

88
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,759
I had no idea

89
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:08,959
you were this handy.

90
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,879
Glad you like it.

91
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,560
By the way, Anda.

92
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,600
Since you're so capable,

93
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,079
I have another important favor to ask.

94
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,480
It's about this painting.

95
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,680
There's an art exhibition on Mikaiyang Street.

96
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:26,680
This painting... right here, this one.

97
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,079
C-Can you buy it for me?

98
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,519
It's hard for me to get around.

99
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,879
Well, the paintings there are pretty expensive.

100
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:35,680
Anda, what are you trying to say?

101
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:39,079
Am I, Xiao Chuan, really that stingy?

102
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:41,360
You just buy this painting for me.

103
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,360
Give me your bank account number,

104
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,680
and I'll wire you the money right away.

105
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,399
Don't worry.

106
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,680
Relax, don't worry at all.

107
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,879
I trust you completely.

108
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:49,000
Just this one.

109
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,959
Anda, um...

110
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:58,160
If you're busy, you can get back to it.

111
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:05,240
I... I'll fly it for you.

112
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:17,120
Qu, pass me that sandwich.

113
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,040
I'm in a rush.

114
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:21,600
Wait, you're off work today.

115
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:23,519
What are you in such a hurry for?

116
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,800
Xiao Chuan asked me to handle something.

117
00:07:27,439 --> 00:07:29,079
Did Xiao Chuan mention

118
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,079
how he got hurt?

119
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,439
He couldn't really say either.

120
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,920
Then don't believe him.

121
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:36,680
I'm heading out now.

122
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:47,279
Could you back off a bit?

123
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,000
A bit further.

124
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,279
I'll replace your clothes.

125
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,399
Let go.

126
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,879
I'll buy you new clothes.

127
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:08,959
No need.

128
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:11,759
Then come out with me.

129
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:12,759
I have things to buy.

130
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:14,319
Let go.

131
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:17,720
Not unless you come with me.

132
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:19,800
How can we go shopping if you don't let go?

133
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,639
This is it. This is the one.

134
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:36,720
This one.

135
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,679
Do you like it?

136
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,600
How much is this?

137
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,759
60. 60.

138
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:42,200
Too expensive. I only have 40.

139
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:42,960
Make it 40.

140
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,799
No way, 60 is firm.

141
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,519
40. I only have 40. 40.

142
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,080
60 is my lowest.

143
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:46,759
Come on, sell it to me.

144
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:48,720
We have to keep ten for food.

145
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,159
How about 30?

146
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:51,399
No, I can't.

147
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:52,759
30.

148
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,600
40. 40.

149
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,240
Let's go.

150
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,200
Fine, 30, it's yours!

151
00:08:58,799 --> 00:09:00,159
Business is so tough.

152
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,120
How are you so good at bargaining?

153
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,840
You're really amazing!

154
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:22,440
This outfit looks so pretty.

155
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:25,240
It's been so long since I wore nice clothes.

156
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,399
I'll go inside and take a look.

157
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:28,200
Hold this for me, will you?

158
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:30,000
I really feel safe with you around.

159
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,879
Wait a second.

160
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,519
Here you go.

161
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:58,240
Thank you.

162
00:10:12,799 --> 00:10:14,600
Wei Tian, does this look good?

163
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,080
Does this look good with it?

164
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:25,679
Wei Tian.

165
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,440
Do you think it looks good?

166
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:30,480
Wei Tian. Wei Tian!

167
00:10:32,559 --> 00:10:33,519
Does this look good?

168
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:34,919
It looks good.

169
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,039
Anda.

170
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,240
Wei Tian.

171
00:10:56,679 --> 00:10:58,480
Why would they be shopping together?

172
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:03,480
If she went shopping, Anda should've invited me.

173
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,639
Foolish.

174
00:11:08,759 --> 00:11:10,440
I think Anda just wasn't thinking straight.

175
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,679
You were the one who told me

176
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,279
to keep an eye on Anda

177
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,480
in case she was in danger.

178
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,080
That's why I showed

179
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:18,919
the most crucial intel to you.

180
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:22,120
Aren't they just two photos?

181
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,000
They don't really prove anything.

182
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,279
Tell me,

183
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,879
Anda couldn't really be in love with Wei Tian, could she?

184
00:11:37,879 --> 00:11:38,720
Impossible.

185
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:40,360
Even if Anda agreed,

186
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,639
Wei Tian never would.

187
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,960
What if Wei Tian fell for Anda?

188
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:49,559
Would the two of us have to fight it out?

189
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:52,279
Could you even beat him?

190
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:55,080
If we really fought,

191
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,919
who knows who'd take down whom?

192
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,279
It's not about fighting.

193
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:03,120
The thing is, Anda isn't right for Wei Tian.

194
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:04,759
Who's not right?

195
00:12:05,039 --> 00:12:06,759
I think Anda isn't right for him.

196
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,000
Besides, Wei Tian hasn't done anything to her.

197
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,559
All he did was go shopping with her

198
00:12:10,559 --> 00:12:12,000
and take some photos.

199
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:14,440
No, their age gap is huge.

200
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,639
How could they be right for each other?

201
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,759
Tell me,

202
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,200
does Anda have feelings for me?

203
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,440
I think

204
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,679
she probably does.

205
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:29,639
Why else would she ask you

206
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:30,720
to protect her when things were at their most dangerous?

207
00:12:34,159 --> 00:12:35,279
That's what I think too.

208
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:39,600
No,

209
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,399
I need to go talk to Wei Tian and clear this up.

210
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:45,559
About us meeting in secret like this,

211
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,399
make sure you don't tell anyone.

212
00:12:47,399 --> 00:12:48,399
Especially Wei Tian.

213
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,679
Th-This is the one.

214
00:12:55,679 --> 00:12:57,639
Do you know how long I've looked for this painting?

215
00:12:57,639 --> 00:12:58,960
It wasn't easy at all.

216
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,440
Bring it closer, closer.

217
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:02,720
A bit closer.

218
00:13:03,559 --> 00:13:04,279
H-Hand it to me.

219
00:13:06,799 --> 00:13:08,320
It's gorgeous.

220
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,679
Well, Xiao Chuan,

221
00:13:11,159 --> 00:13:13,679
if there's nothing else, I'll take off.

222
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,120
That's all. Go ahead.

223
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,879
Wei Tian!

224
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,639
Wei Tian!

225
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:22,799
Where's Wei Tian?

226
00:13:22,879 --> 00:13:23,759
Who are you?

227
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:26,120
I'm Xiang Lai. Who is she?

228
00:13:26,879 --> 00:13:27,679
Rossi.

229
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,519
Rossi?

230
00:13:31,759 --> 00:13:33,879
Why would a Chinese person use a foreign name?

231
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:37,679
Wait,

232
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:38,440
where's Wei Tian?

233
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,279
He's out on business.

234
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,080
Out on business?

235
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:42,559
Yeah.

236
00:13:42,559 --> 00:13:43,639
When will he be back?

237
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,480
I have no idea.

238
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,919
What is it? Something come up?

239
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,039
Kind of.

240
00:13:50,799 --> 00:13:51,759
Then I'll wait for him here.

241
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,200
Did he get on your bad side?

242
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,559
Him?

243
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:02,000
Xiang Lai, what are you doing here?

244
00:14:03,399 --> 00:14:04,320
Good timing.

245
00:14:06,759 --> 00:14:07,799
Who is he?

246
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,360
This is our base.

247
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:11,080
Can he just come and go whenever he wants?

248
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,240
Xiang Lai.

249
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,320
From Zhong'an.

250
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,759
He's been here several times.

251
00:14:16,879 --> 00:14:18,200
Right, and you weren't around.

252
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,320
I came to pick you up.

253
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,919
Pick me up? Go where?

254
00:14:24,759 --> 00:14:26,799
I found an apartment for you near Zhong'an.

255
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:29,159
It's close to your hotel and convenient for work.

256
00:14:29,279 --> 00:14:30,480
Why would I go there?

257
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,159
Isn't it fine living here?

258
00:14:33,919 --> 00:14:34,759
You don't understand.

259
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:36,559
These people are all unlicensed bodyguards.

260
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,519
Who are you calling an unlicensed bodyguard?

261
00:14:39,679 --> 00:14:40,720
You're the unlicensed bodyguard!

262
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,080
We are not unlicensed bodyguards!

263
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,159
Staying here is way too dangerous for you.

264
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:52,360
I actually like these people.

265
00:14:52,919 --> 00:14:55,440
I don't want to move. They treat me well.

266
00:14:55,919 --> 00:14:56,799
Let me ask you.

267
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,759
Are you sure you want to stay here?

268
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:01,360
Of course.

269
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,000
Aren't I doing just fine living here?

270
00:15:03,279 --> 00:15:04,120
Go on with your work.

271
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,879
I'm sorry.

272
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,399
We can't take this job.

273
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,480
You should go to the local Bituo company instead.

274
00:15:26,159 --> 00:15:27,559
They've already turned us down.

275
00:15:27,559 --> 00:15:29,039
That's why I came here.

276
00:15:29,919 --> 00:15:31,159
The location you want to deliver medicine to

277
00:15:31,399 --> 00:15:33,320
is crawling with terrorists.

278
00:15:34,039 --> 00:15:35,840
We can't guarantee your safety,

279
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,320
nor can we

280
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:39,080
guarantee the safety of our escort team.

281
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,279
I'm sorry.

282
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:44,919
You should find another company.

283
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:46,960
Thank you.

284
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,120
Xiang Lai,

285
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,039
as per your instructions,

286
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,320
we turned them down.

287
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,039
Please take a look.

288
00:16:43,399 --> 00:16:44,279
It's too sweet.

289
00:16:45,759 --> 00:16:46,840
Anda, come here.

290
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,159
Have some pudding.

291
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,639
Recruiting volunteers for the Muru Tribe

292
00:16:57,639 --> 00:16:59,120
to provide charitable medical aid.

293
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,920
Near the Muru Tribe,

294
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,440
a terrorist attack has occurred.

295
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:09,799
Currently, various factions

296
00:17:09,799 --> 00:17:10,920
continue to clash.

297
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,640
Stay tuned for our follow-up reports.

298
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,519
The Muru Tribe is

299
00:17:15,519 --> 00:17:16,920
an isolated place,

300
00:17:17,799 --> 00:17:19,279
and fighting has broken out recently.

301
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:21,839
Charitable medical aid...

302
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:23,759
Why would they go to such a dangerous place?

303
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:27,400
Something's fishy.

304
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:31,160
Sha Lan, look into this.

305
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,400
Stop looking at that.

306
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,839
I really want to volunteer this time.

307
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,640
Look, they're giving out free medicine.

308
00:18:09,119 --> 00:18:10,240
Come on, Anda.

309
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,119
Can you stop preaching?

310
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,599
Do you really think going there

311
00:18:13,599 --> 00:18:14,279
and doing charity work

312
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:15,759
will get you transferred back home right away?

313
00:18:15,799 --> 00:18:16,599
Wrong.

314
00:18:17,279 --> 00:18:18,440
They'll just keep you here

315
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,359
to keep doing charity.

316
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,400
I just feel

317
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,440
they're poor and having a tough time.

318
00:18:23,799 --> 00:18:26,720
I want to do what I can to help them.

319
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:29,440
Are you really that naive, or playing dumb?

320
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,000
What's so great about that place?

321
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:33,480
Poor sanitation, harsh conditions,

322
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:34,559
and uncivilized people.

323
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,480
Do you not want to make it back alive?

324
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,200
Checking in.

325
00:18:45,799 --> 00:18:46,599
One moment, please.

326
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,599
This is organized by our company—

327
00:18:49,599 --> 00:18:51,119
a humanitarian relief effort.

328
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,400
If you're interested, you can sign up.

329
00:18:53,839 --> 00:18:55,680
We'll be heading to the Muru Tribe.

330
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,839
It'll last three days.

331
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:02,160
Do you have any recommendations

332
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:03,119
for security companies

333
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:05,079
or guides to get us there safely?

334
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:10,119
There are many local security companies.

335
00:19:12,039 --> 00:19:13,680
You can look them up online.

336
00:19:14,359 --> 00:19:17,599
Still, on behalf of the tribes, thank you.

337
00:19:17,599 --> 00:19:19,400
Welcome to Plato Hotel.

338
00:19:21,359 --> 00:19:21,960
Thank you.

339
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:22,880
Thank you.

340
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:28,720
I was afraid you'd say something reckless.

341
00:19:28,839 --> 00:19:30,200
After all, we're in a foreign country.

342
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:32,359
Can we just mind our own business?

343
00:19:43,519 --> 00:19:45,559
Wei Tian, take a look at this.

344
00:19:45,839 --> 00:19:46,640
Are we taking it?

345
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,519
Pass.

346
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,079
You're so picky about jobs now.

347
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,759
And you call yourself an adult.

348
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:57,720
Only adults have the right to be picky.

349
00:20:02,039 --> 00:20:03,680
Why reject this request?

350
00:20:03,839 --> 00:20:05,039
There's something shady about this company.

351
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:08,240
They're doing humanitarian work.

352
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:09,319
It saves lives for free.

353
00:20:09,559 --> 00:20:10,279
If these medicines

354
00:20:10,279 --> 00:20:12,160
can reach those patients sooner,

355
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:14,039
won't that ease their suffering?

356
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:15,759
You said our hotel's job was too small,

357
00:20:15,759 --> 00:20:17,200
but this one isn't small at all.

358
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,319
It's a big company, too.

359
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,599
So why won't you take it?

360
00:20:20,279 --> 00:20:21,000
As for our work,

361
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,759
since when do you get to boss us around?

362
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,400
Looks like this month's rent

363
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,319
hasn't been paid yet, right?

364
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,799
Balkan powder keg.

365
00:20:31,279 --> 00:20:32,720
I'll go get it right now.

366
00:20:35,279 --> 00:20:37,359
How has that naive woman managed to survive?

367
00:20:38,799 --> 00:20:39,440
You see,

368
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,680
she was born in a peaceful country.

369
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:43,400
No war,

370
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:44,640
plenty of food and warm clothes.

371
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:45,640
That's why

372
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:47,119
she doesn't think like you.

373
00:20:51,839 --> 00:20:52,519
See you next time.

374
00:20:52,759 --> 00:20:53,319
Okay.

375
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:53,920
Goodbye.

376
00:20:54,119 --> 00:20:54,599
Bye.

377
00:21:01,079 --> 00:21:03,079
Zuo Feichen handed the restaurant over to you?

378
00:21:04,079 --> 00:21:04,880
Not bad.

379
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:07,200
If you're willing to be the boss here,

380
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,279
I'll buy the place.

381
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:09,279
You run the inside, I handle the outside.

382
00:21:11,119 --> 00:21:12,240
In your dreams.

383
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:13,960
Why did you ask to see me?

384
00:21:16,319 --> 00:21:19,240
There's an international humanitarian group

385
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:22,160
delivering free medicine to the Muru Tribe.

386
00:21:22,319 --> 00:21:24,039
They're looking for security personnel,

387
00:21:24,079 --> 00:21:25,720
so I thought of Zhong'an.

388
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:27,960
Wei Tian won't take this job?

389
00:21:29,119 --> 00:21:29,960
Knowing them,

390
00:21:30,799 --> 00:21:33,400
they probably think the pay is too low.

391
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:34,160
So...

392
00:21:34,799 --> 00:21:35,599
But I think

393
00:21:35,599 --> 00:21:37,880
this is a truly great cause.

394
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:40,319
So I applied to be a volunteer for them.

395
00:21:42,039 --> 00:21:44,240
Great, then I can protect you.

396
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,440
Let's go.

397
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:57,680
Tell you what, let me get you two some food.

398
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:00,960
Wei Tian.

399
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:03,599
Why won't you take the pharma company's job?

400
00:22:04,079 --> 00:22:05,240
There's something shady about this company.

401
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:08,559
Take my advice: don't take it either.

402
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:11,640
Zhong'an isn't like you guys,

403
00:22:12,039 --> 00:22:13,200
only caring about money.

404
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,720
Fine, then.

405
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,319
Suit yourselves.

406
00:22:16,319 --> 00:22:18,200
Actually, there's a question I've wanted to ask.

407
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:20,480
Who are the Silent Protectors, really?

408
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:21,960
Why do you do things

409
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,240
with zero restraint?

410
00:22:25,319 --> 00:22:26,680
Some work for money.

411
00:22:27,519 --> 00:22:28,839
Some work for people.

412
00:22:29,319 --> 00:22:30,839
Some work for passion.

413
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:33,480
Out here, you can do whatever you want.

414
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,880
Why bother caring about me?

415
00:22:38,319 --> 00:22:39,440
I can't help but care.

416
00:22:40,319 --> 00:22:41,319
Judging by the way you operate

417
00:22:41,319 --> 00:22:42,559
and the skills you have,

418
00:22:43,079 --> 00:22:44,279
you're definitely no ordinary guy.

419
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,480
Xiang Lai,

420
00:22:55,839 --> 00:22:57,519
the first payment will be transferred

421
00:22:57,519 --> 00:22:59,240
to your company's account within an hour.

422
00:22:59,279 --> 00:23:00,720
Make sure you're fully prepared.

423
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:02,000
We leave in three days.

424
00:23:02,319 --> 00:23:03,119
Pleasure doing business with you.

425
00:23:03,119 --> 00:23:03,799
Thank you.

426
00:23:04,519 --> 00:23:05,079
Thank you.

427
00:23:05,079 --> 00:23:05,880
Pleasure doing business.

428
00:23:13,799 --> 00:23:14,680
Thanks a lot.

429
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:16,759
Why thank me?

430
00:23:17,599 --> 00:23:19,680
Xiao Chuan and I took annual leave

431
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:22,359
to join as volunteers.

432
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:27,519
Ancient tribe, here I come!

433
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,000
Do a good job.

434
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,599
I'll keep you safe.

435
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:47,039
Dad,

436
00:23:47,519 --> 00:23:48,880
why did you take this job?

437
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:50,920
Doing the right thing can't wait.

438
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:51,839
I wasn't asking you.

439
00:23:52,039 --> 00:23:53,160
Don't get cheeky with me.

440
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,200
There's something off about this institute.

441
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:57,079
Besides, the military in this area

442
00:23:57,079 --> 00:23:57,920
and the militants

443
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,240
just clashed.

444
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,319
You know you can't carry a gun.

445
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,440
What if something happens?

446
00:24:03,039 --> 00:24:04,640
Dad, I'm losing reception.

447
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,559
Talk to you later.

448
00:24:05,559 --> 00:24:06,720
Gotta go, bye.

449
00:24:14,119 --> 00:24:15,880
This time, I applied to be

450
00:24:16,279 --> 00:24:17,880
a volunteer delivering medicine.

451
00:24:17,880 --> 00:24:19,440
No matter the dangers ahead,

452
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:20,960
I'll definitely complete the mission.

453
00:24:26,759 --> 00:24:27,960
Even a small noise like that

454
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,440
spooked you.

455
00:24:29,559 --> 00:24:31,680
Can you really handle a war zone?

456
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:36,039
Xiang Lai will protect me.

457
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:39,359
Follow me.

458
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:54,559
Give it a try. Pick it up.

459
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:57,240
Why do you have a gun?

460
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:59,319
This is our security training ground,

461
00:25:00,079 --> 00:25:01,880
and these guns are just for practice.

462
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:02,960
Try it out.

463
00:25:04,319 --> 00:25:05,920
I'm never touching one of those again.

464
00:25:06,079 --> 00:25:08,079
You forced me to back at the hotel.

465
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:08,960
You said we're all Chinese

466
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:09,799
and had to stick together,

467
00:25:09,799 --> 00:25:11,519
or we'd die. That's the only reason I held it.

468
00:25:11,519 --> 00:25:12,680
I'm never picking one up again.

469
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:16,839
This isn't Shenzhen.

470
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:18,400
It's Antilocaris.

471
00:25:18,799 --> 00:25:21,039
There are dangers here you know nothing about.

472
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:25,000
You don't even have the guts to practice with a gun.

473
00:25:25,599 --> 00:25:27,079
Where you're going is dangerous.

474
00:25:27,599 --> 00:25:29,160
I suggest you don't go.

475
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:31,119
I'm not scared.

476
00:25:31,519 --> 00:25:33,200
I even hired another security firm

477
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:34,440
to protect me.

478
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:35,799
Didn't you say

479
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:38,319
we have to stick together?

480
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:39,480
Then why don't you come along, too?

481
00:26:04,279 --> 00:26:06,720
Someone said he wasn't coming, yet here he is.

482
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:09,279
Disguising yourself as a driver took quite some effort.

483
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:11,400
Wei Tian, I knew you'd come.

484
00:26:11,519 --> 00:26:14,000
I was just worried someone wasn't up to the task.

485
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:29,799
Get out.

486
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:31,319
Don't get out.

487
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:31,720
Get out.

488
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:32,440
Wait for me here.

489
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:33,599
Hurry.

490
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:29,359
Stop the car.

491
00:27:48,799 --> 00:27:49,799
What did you give them?

492
00:27:50,359 --> 00:27:51,160
Essential Balm.

493
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:51,920
It's that simple.

494
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:52,440
Let's go.

495
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:40,400
Welcome, welcome!

496
00:28:42,440 --> 00:28:43,920
Welcome, welcome!

497
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:45,440
Welcome, everyone!

498
00:28:45,440 --> 00:28:47,319
Welcome, welcome, welcome!

499
00:28:47,519 --> 00:28:48,720
Welcome, welcome!

500
00:28:48,759 --> 00:28:49,640
Welcome!

501
00:28:49,799 --> 00:28:50,559
Thank you all!

502
00:28:50,559 --> 00:28:51,039
Welcome!

503
00:28:51,039 --> 00:28:51,519
Hello!

504
00:28:51,519 --> 00:28:52,240
Come on in!

505
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:53,039
Welcome, everyone!

506
00:28:53,039 --> 00:28:54,119
Thank you so much!

507
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,400
Thank you. Welcome!

508
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:58,279
I'm so happy. Here's a flower for you.

509
00:28:58,279 --> 00:28:58,640
Thank you.

510
00:28:58,640 --> 00:28:59,400
Hello, everyone!

511
00:28:59,519 --> 00:29:01,039
Here. Thank you all, thank you.

512
00:29:01,039 --> 00:29:01,680
Hello!

513
00:29:02,599 --> 00:29:03,039
Hello!

514
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:09,599
Wei Tian, are you there?

515
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:32,119
Where's Wei Tian? Where did he go?

516
00:29:32,119 --> 00:29:32,920
He's not in his room either.

517
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:44,039
I'm going to find him.

518
00:29:44,039 --> 00:29:44,720
Wait a second.

519
00:29:45,079 --> 00:29:45,880
Tell me the truth.

520
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,799
Where on earth did he go?

521
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:51,319
He took a bulletproof vest from me today...

522
00:29:51,319 --> 00:29:52,039
...and left.

523
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:54,039
What? A bulletproof vest?

524
00:29:54,839 --> 00:29:56,559
I knew he couldn't just let Anda go.

525
00:29:56,839 --> 00:29:57,640
Seriously,

526
00:29:57,759 --> 00:29:59,400
this habit of his to rush and save everyone...

527
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:00,519
when will he ever change it?

528
00:30:00,519 --> 00:30:01,480
Does he even know...

529
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,680
...what kind of people he's up against?

530
00:30:03,319 --> 00:30:05,279
Stop shouting. He can't hear you anyway.

531
00:30:09,319 --> 00:30:10,839
What's wrong? What happened?

532
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:24,079
Looks like this time,

533
00:30:24,279 --> 00:30:26,079
we need to be ready to extract Wei Tian.

534
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:29,200
We can't let him get exposed.

535
00:30:32,799 --> 00:30:35,039
Can you try reaching Wei Tian again?

536
00:30:35,960 --> 00:30:37,519
I've thought of everything I could.

537
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:39,359
I've tried everything possible.

538
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,319
But it's a war zone over there.

539
00:30:40,319 --> 00:30:41,359
All signals are blocked.

540
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:42,400
There's no way to reach him.

541
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:46,240
In that case,

542
00:30:46,759 --> 00:30:47,839
we need to quickly gather

543
00:30:47,839 --> 00:30:48,960
decisive evidence,

544
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:52,079
so this company can't frame them.

545
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,039
Lately,

546
00:30:58,039 --> 00:30:59,519
have you had any unusual reactions?

547
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,279
No.

548
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:04,839
Good, good. Keep taking the medication.

549
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:06,960
Wei Tian, have some water.

550
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,599
Your vitals look pretty good.

551
00:31:12,559 --> 00:31:13,160
Thanks.

552
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:05,680
Water. It's our own.

553
00:32:12,519 --> 00:32:13,240
How are you doing?

554
00:32:14,039 --> 00:32:15,039
Regretting it yet?

555
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:19,960
No, I just swallowed a fly.

556
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:23,720
If you get diarrhea, go see Xiang Lai.

557
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:26,480
Let me grab something from the car for you to eat.

558
00:32:26,519 --> 00:32:27,799
Why are you being so nice?

559
00:32:29,839 --> 00:32:30,359
Thanks.

560
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:51,920
Thank you!

561
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:54,000
Miss, over here!

562
00:32:58,839 --> 00:33:00,799
I want one too! Can I have one, please?

563
00:33:00,799 --> 00:33:01,440
Can I have one, please?

564
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,400
All right, all right. Here you go.

565
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:04,480
All right, this one is yours.

566
00:33:04,839 --> 00:33:05,319
Thank you.

567
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:06,640
Here.

568
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:07,720
Thank you!

569
00:33:07,960 --> 00:33:09,119
Give me another one!

570
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,359
It's so yummy!

571
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:19,519
The sky here is so beautiful.

572
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:21,799
It makes me feel so relaxed.

573
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:25,680
Relaxing as it is,

574
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:27,880
put this ring on your finger.

575
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:30,039
If an enemy comes, punch them,

576
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,119
then turn around and run.

577
00:33:32,599 --> 00:33:33,680
What are you guys doing here?

578
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:34,960
Here, take this.

579
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:36,160
I specifically brought you mosquito repellent.

580
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:38,000
There are lots of mosquitoes, so watch out for bites.

581
00:33:38,039 --> 00:33:39,000
Bites can easily lead to malaria.

582
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:42,480
They suspect we gave her poison.

583
00:33:42,799 --> 00:33:43,920
That's impossible.

584
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:45,720
She has parasites in her body.

585
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:48,119
I only prescribed her a deworming drug.

586
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:50,039
I don't understand why she passed out.

587
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:53,119
The drug might have caused an adverse reaction.

588
00:33:53,119 --> 00:33:54,519
We have medication to counteract it.

589
00:33:54,519 --> 00:33:55,680
We can give her an injection.

590
00:33:55,920 --> 00:33:57,680
If you can save her,

591
00:33:57,680 --> 00:33:59,279
I'll believe you.

592
00:34:00,799 --> 00:34:01,680
You heard that, right?

593
00:34:21,239 --> 00:34:22,039
You're awake.

594
00:34:27,639 --> 00:34:28,079
Come.

595
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:30,199
Come over here.

596
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:38,280
Here, take this.

597
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:38,679
Thank you.

598
00:34:38,679 --> 00:34:39,519
Once you get this shot,

599
00:34:39,519 --> 00:34:41,239
your symptoms will ease up.

600
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:53,559
Here you go.

601
00:34:53,559 --> 00:34:54,199
Thank you, mister.

602
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:55,000
Thank you, mister.

603
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,000
Come on, take some.

604
00:34:56,519 --> 00:34:57,480
Thank you, mister.

605
00:34:57,719 --> 00:34:58,440
Come on, take some.

606
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,159
Thank you.

607
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,880
This candy is for the kids.

608
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,199
Why are you taking it from them?

609
00:35:04,599 --> 00:35:06,599
Your candy tastes like medicine.

610
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:10,039
You draw blood and hand out bread,

611
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:12,880
and this candy has medicine in it.

612
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,400
Why is that?

613
00:35:15,719 --> 00:35:18,039
How about this? You eat it.

614
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:21,559
Don't throw the candy! Don't throw it!

615
00:35:21,559 --> 00:35:23,920
Candy is sweet. Why would you throw it?

616
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:31,960
Your medicine kills people!

617
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,320
I'll kill you!

618
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:47,719
Something is definitely wrong with this medicine.

619
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:52,840
Won't they think

620
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:54,280
we're in on it too?

621
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,559
They're bad guys!

622
00:36:00,559 --> 00:36:00,960
Quick!

623
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:05,280
Don't let them get away!

624
00:36:23,559 --> 00:36:24,719
No, don't!

625
00:36:24,719 --> 00:36:25,880
What the hell is going on?

626
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:27,039
Why are they dead?

627
00:36:27,159 --> 00:36:29,320
I don't know, I don't know anything!

628
00:36:29,400 --> 00:36:30,920
They just hired me!

629
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:31,800
You're lying!

630
00:36:32,920 --> 00:36:34,599
You want me to throw you out of the car?

631
00:36:34,599 --> 00:36:35,440
You have to believe me!

632
00:36:35,440 --> 00:36:36,760
I really don't know anything!

633
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:37,800
Tell me the truth, now!

634
00:36:38,039 --> 00:36:38,880
Stop pushing him.

635
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:40,159
He really doesn't know anything.

636
00:37:07,039 --> 00:37:07,400
Come on.

637
00:37:14,079 --> 00:37:14,760
Turn around.

638
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:23,920
Take all the medicine off.

639
00:37:25,079 --> 00:37:25,480
Hurry.

640
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:37,679
Give me the blood sample.

641
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:44,639
You can't give him the blood sample!

642
00:37:44,639 --> 00:37:45,679
They've killed people!

643
00:37:55,079 --> 00:37:56,119
Start the car, quick!

644
00:38:34,599 --> 00:38:35,400
Anda!

645
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:38,800
Anda, Anda, are you okay?

646
00:38:39,920 --> 00:38:40,760
You're hurt.

647
00:38:43,679 --> 00:38:45,119
No, I'm fine.

648
00:38:45,599 --> 00:38:47,039
If it weren't for me,

649
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:52,199
you wouldn't have been tricked into coming here.

650
00:38:53,039 --> 00:38:55,000
Silly girl, don't say that.

651
00:38:56,119 --> 00:38:56,920
Is it serious?

652
00:38:58,000 --> 00:39:00,599
It's all my fault. It's on me.

653
00:39:01,039 --> 00:39:02,480
Come on, let me see.

654
00:39:03,679 --> 00:39:05,559
You two, call an ambulance for them.

655
00:39:05,559 --> 00:39:06,400
Let's go.

656
00:39:08,079 --> 00:39:10,079
Here, let me help you up. Can you walk?

657
00:39:11,480 --> 00:39:12,440
Easy, take it slow.

658
00:39:20,719 --> 00:39:22,760
We've already gathered enough evidence

659
00:39:22,880 --> 00:39:24,639
to prove that this pharmaceutical company

660
00:39:24,639 --> 00:39:27,239
has been running drug trials in the Muru Tribe.

661
00:39:27,719 --> 00:39:28,440
And,

662
00:39:28,440 --> 00:39:30,440
we've also taken down one of their branches.

663
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:33,840
I'll send all these files over to you.

664
00:39:37,679 --> 00:39:39,559
The files you worked so hard to get...

665
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:41,840
you're just handing them over to me like that?

666
00:39:42,639 --> 00:39:44,440
Isn't that a bit rash?

667
00:39:46,519 --> 00:39:47,719
Not at all.

668
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:50,719
You're the reputable Zhong'an Group, after all.

669
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:53,039
Even the best make mistakes sometimes.

670
00:39:53,400 --> 00:39:54,239
So,

671
00:39:55,880 --> 00:39:57,119
you don't need to dwell on it.

672
00:39:58,320 --> 00:40:01,159
Earlier, I found your security agreement.

673
00:40:01,719 --> 00:40:03,079
The signatory on it

674
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,840
is someone named Xiang Lai.

675
00:40:05,519 --> 00:40:06,719
You know him, right?

676
00:40:06,880 --> 00:40:10,280
This matter is indeed our responsibility.

677
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,679
There's an old Chinese saying:

678
00:40:13,119 --> 00:40:14,159
"Where you fall,

679
00:40:14,159 --> 00:40:15,480
that's where you pick yourself back up."

680
00:40:15,559 --> 00:40:16,800
What do you think?

681
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:20,159
As long as you return this security agreement to me,

682
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:22,880
we'll take full responsibility.

683
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:24,559
I hope

684
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:26,840
you can make the pharma company's files public.

685
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:31,079
Alright, I agree.

686
00:40:31,559 --> 00:40:32,760
If you're willing,

687
00:40:32,760 --> 00:40:34,079
you can come to the Muru Tribe

688
00:40:34,079 --> 00:40:35,719
to provide genuine charitable medical aid.

689
00:40:45,039 --> 00:40:48,079
Also, I hope you'll forget

690
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:50,599
that I ever gave you this evidence.

691
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:52,559
Why?

692
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:55,079
Because our little Silent Protectors team

693
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:56,880
doesn't want retaliation from the bad guys.

694
00:40:59,360 --> 00:41:01,599
Fine, I agree to that, too.

695
00:41:02,559 --> 00:41:05,039
Here's to a smooth cooperation, then.

696
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:07,599
Rossi,

697
00:41:08,559 --> 00:41:10,159
our work here is basically finished.

698
00:41:10,159 --> 00:41:11,199
Let's get ready to pull out.

699
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:20,400
Don't worry about what you asked me to do.

700
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:23,599
Don't mention it.

701
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:25,320
I still owe you a lot.

702
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:28,119
I don't want to bring danger to those around me.

703
00:41:29,239 --> 00:41:30,840
I'll keep concealing my identity

704
00:41:31,559 --> 00:41:32,840
until I find Hades.

705
00:41:57,000 --> 00:41:59,559
Didn't think you'd still be in this line of work.

706
00:42:15,119 --> 00:42:19,079
This time, I won't let you get away.

707
00:42:25,599 --> 00:42:27,360
Protecting the pharmaceutical company this time—

708
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:29,119
how did it go?

709
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:32,400
I realized

710
00:42:32,880 --> 00:42:34,239
that I still have a lot of flaws,

711
00:42:34,639 --> 00:42:35,880
and I didn't think things through.

712
00:42:36,159 --> 00:42:37,159
I was almost fooled.

713
00:42:39,679 --> 00:42:40,880
Look at you being humble.

714
00:42:45,159 --> 00:42:46,199
This also goes to show

715
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:49,880
that the security situation in Antilocaris

716
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:51,559
is extremely complicated.

717
00:42:51,960 --> 00:42:53,400
It's not just terrorists;

718
00:42:53,920 --> 00:42:56,519
there are many other factions at play.

719
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:59,880
The largest Chinese enterprise in Antilocaris,

720
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:01,000
the Plato Hotel,

721
00:43:01,280 --> 00:43:03,280
will be our key security focus moving forward.

722
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:04,880
I've already spoken

723
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:05,840
with their head office.

724
00:43:05,920 --> 00:43:08,760
We'll be taking charge of their security.

725
00:43:11,800 --> 00:43:13,119
I was actually planning to expand Zhong'an's footprint

726
00:43:13,599 --> 00:43:15,800
in Antilocaris on my own,

727
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:17,559
but you took care of everything for me again.

728
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:18,639
Nonsense.

729
00:43:22,320 --> 00:43:23,559
To let Chinese enterprises

730
00:43:23,559 --> 00:43:25,800
grow overseas with peace of mind,

731
00:43:26,679 --> 00:43:29,280
our Zhong'an Group still has a long road ahead.

732
00:43:30,559 --> 00:43:33,480
You have a massive task ahead of you, too.

733
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:35,280
Understood.
